      "How do you say happy new year in Telugu?",
      "Ugadi Shubhakankshalu (ఉగాది శుభాకాంక్షలు) is the greeting for Ugadi. For the 1 January new year, use Nutana Samvatsara Shubhakankshalu (నూతన సంవత్సర శుభాకాంక్షలు), which simply means new year greetings."
